CREATED:20260218T173419Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T231334Z
UID:10003012-1783328400-1783701000@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Camp Freeze 2 (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Keep cool this summer by making ice cream\, mixing snow slime and snowball soap\, and exploring other cool and creative projects. Plus\, ice skate at Snoopy’s Home Ice from 12:30-2:00 pm every day (except Tuesday)! A skate lesson is included on Monday. Instructor: Rachel Aragaki
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/camp-freeze-2-grades-1-3-4/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
