CREATED:20260218T173944Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260417T232140Z
UID:10003014-1783328400-1783701000@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Camp Freeze 4 (Grades 4-6)
DESCRIPTION:Chill out this summer with cool and creative projects! Make ice cream in a bag\, grow a crystal tree\, and create a sparkling luminary. Also\, ice skate at Snoopy’s Home Ice from 12:30-2:00 pm every day (except Tuesday)! A skate lesson is included on Monday. Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/camp-freeze-4-grades-4-6-7/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
