SUMMARY:Second Saturday Cartoonist: Mariano Velasco
DESCRIPTION:Meet\, watch\, and talk to Mariano Velasco\, cartoonist and creator of the independent comic strip and children’s book series The Boy and The Thing.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/second-saturday-cartoonist-mariano-velasco/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260713T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T123000
DTSTAMP:20260611T162129Z
CREATED:20260218T175828Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260611T162129Z
UID:10003019-1783933200-1784291400@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Comic Creators Boot Camp with Nathan Hale (Grades 4-6)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. From single-panel jokes to starting a graphic novel\, learn the basics of writing and drawing comics with New York Times best-selling graphic novelist Nathan Hale\, creator of the Hazardous Tales series. This class will cover character design\, panel layouts\, visual gags\, action scenes\, and everything a young artist needs to know to tell stories in the comic format.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/comic-creators-boot-camp-with-nathan-hale-grades-4-6-2/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260713T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T123000
DTSTAMP:20260520T231153Z
CREATED:20260218T175855Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T231153Z
UID:10003022-1783933200-1784291400@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Art Lab (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Get messy mixing art and science! Make scratch-and-sniff artwork\, sculpt homemade clay\, create masterpieces with marble diffusion\, experiment with surprising chemical reactions\, and learn the science behind animation. Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/art-lab-grades-1-3-7/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260713T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T163000
