CREATED:20260218T175650Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260417T232349Z
UID:10003016-1783947600-1784305800@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Digital Portfolio (Grades 6 and up)
DESCRIPTION:Hone your digital art skills and explore several iPad apps to help you express your creativity. Learn Procreate\, Nomad Sculpt\, and other apps to build a dynamic digital portfolio of finished projects. Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/digital-portfolio-grades-6-and-up/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260713T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T163000
DTSTAMP:20260417T232247Z
CREATED:20260218T175731Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260417T232247Z
UID:10003017-1783947600-1784305800@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Cartooning Around (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:Explore the Museum’s exhibition Snoopy’s Family with an iPad scavenger hunt. Then\, learn to draw the Peanuts characters\, collage and create some characters of your own\, and spend time in the galleries getting into storytelling\, comic and book-making\, hand-drawn animation\, and Peanuts-themed projects. Instructor: Rachael Juarez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/cartooning-around-grades-1-3/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
