UID:10002753-1784538000-1784896200@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Outdoor Art and Adventure (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Get up\, go\, and create! Keep moving all week with outdoor games and art activities. Mold a clay mosaic\, create leaf prints\, make a nature bookmark\, paint with fly swatters and sticks\, and enjoy other fun outdoor eco-crafts. Instructor: Rachael Juarez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/outdoor-art-and-adventure-grades-1-3-5/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T090000
