CREATED:20260218T175933Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260417T232648Z
UID:10003023-1784552400-1784910600@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Advanced Movie Making (Grades 6 and up)
DESCRIPTION:Ready\, set\, action! Direct individual and group projects with digital\, hand-drawn\, and stop-motion animation\, and explore live-action movie making with iMovie. Experiment with lighting\, remote cameras\, green screens\, importing and editing\, and end the week with popcorn and a movie screening. Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/advanced-movie-making-grades-6-and-up/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
