UID:10002750-1784552400-1784910600@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Snoopy Safari (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:Take a creative adventure through some of Snoopy’s personas and learn about the animals he impersonates and their habitats. Make your own safari gear and animal avatar\, and explore sharks\, penguins\, polar bears\, snakes\, and more through drawing\, painting\, clay\, and collage. Instructor: Rachael Juarez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/snoopy-safari-grades-1-3/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
