SUMMARY:Peanuts and Kids Cook (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Have a deliciously fun week cooking treats inspired by the Peanuts gang! Make PigPens in a blanket\, Charlie Brownies\, and treats for Snoopy that you can eat\, too! Instructor: Kevin Ger
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/peanuts-and-kids-cook-grades-1-3-5/
