SUMMARY:Museum Mondays for Little Ones: Dog Party
DESCRIPTION:On the last Monday of the month\, enjoy stories\, crafts\, and activities designed for children ages 1-5 and their caregivers. This month\, mix your own puppy kibble\, craft a cool dog bowl\, and enjoy some “wash the dog” sensory play! Also\, learn about adopting older dogs with Brooks Legacy Senior Dog Rescue.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/museum-mondays-for-little-ones-dog-party-or-puppy-love/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
