SUMMARY:Camp Woodstock Mini (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Go on a camp adventure around the Museum and celebrate the smallest Peanuts character–Woodstock! Decorate a birdhouse and birdbath\, make tie-dye t-shirts\, and learn about things that fly by making kites and dragonflies! Children must be at least 4 years old to register. Instructor: Kevin Ger
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/camp-woodstock-mini-grades-tk-k-2/
