SUMMARY:Happy Anniversary\, Schulz Museum!
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Museum’s anniversary and make yourself at home in our home of 24 years! Watch the new Peanuts animated special\, Snoopy Presents: There’s No Place Like Home\, Snoopy (Apple TV)\, on the big screen\, and enjoy live dance performances\, pet adoptions\, a mini sculpting craft\, and hugs with Snoopy!
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/happy-anniversary-schulz-museum-2/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
