DESCRIPTION:Monday\, August 10 is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Enroll in the days you need to make your custom schedule of hands-on winter-themed projects\, games\, and experiments. Also\, ice skate at Snoopy’s Home Ice from 12:30-2:00 pm (except on Tuesday)! Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Monday\, August 10\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Instructor: Mike Marquez
