SUMMARY:Camp Freeze Day Camp Wednesday (Grades 1-6)
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, August 12 is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Chill out this summer with the coolest camp yet! Select the number of days you need to make your custom schedule of hands-on winter-themed projects\, games\, and experiments. Also\, ice skate at Snoopy’s Home Ice from 12:30-2:00 pm! Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Wednesday\, August 12\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Instructor: Mike Marquez
