SUMMARY:Summer Science Mini Day Camp Wednesday (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, August 12 is SOLD OUT. Join the waitlist here. Explore all things summer! On Wednesday\, experiment with chemical reactions. Make mini volcanoes\, mix exploding rainbow reactions\, excavate ice eggs\, and more. Bring a lunch and stay all day. This is a single-day camp for Wednesday\, August 12\, from 9:00 am–4:30 pm\, only. Select the other Summer Science Mini Day Camps to create your custom schedule! Children must be at least 4 years old to register.
